   181	**Stateful orders the two models in opposite directions.** At T=200 Stateful is the best
   182	arm on Haiku (0.999, above SKILL.state's 0.958) and, on Gemini, is indistinguishable
   183	from ReAct (0.930 against 0.913) and well below SKILL.state (1.000). The same
   184	adjudication describes both — it describes, it does not separate causes, because
   185	Stateful and SKILL.state also differ in response format, parsing, retries and prompt
   186	construction, not only in carrying the history:
