   188	- **On Haiku, Stateful writes its state as badly as SKILL.state and loses nothing to
   189	  it.** Its belief departs from reality in 8 of 15 episodes at T=200 — always a correct
   190	  action with a miswritten patch, the same failure as above — yet **none** of its 2
   191	  failures is caused by the state; both happen with a correct one. With the history in
   192	  the prompt, the model does not follow its own wrong state block into a decision.
   193	- **On Gemini it is the other way round.** Its belief departs from reality in 11 of 15
   194	  episodes at T=200 (5 from a miswritten patch, 6 from a wrong action the state did not
   195	  reflect), where SKILL.state on the same model never did in 75. Of its 211 failures, 86
   196	  are caused by the state, 48 occur with a discrepancy that does not explain them, and
   197	  **77 happen with a correct state in front of it**.
