   199	A hypothesis for why fixing the parser changed so little, which we have not tested: in
   200	Stateful the model's responses go into the history, and each contains its own
   201	`StateUpdate: {...}`. The transcript therefore carried a state written by the model
   202	whether or not the runtime applied it, so the defective arm measured "state kept only in
   203	the transcript" rather than "no state".
