   212	−0.037 to +0.197. The control removes the truncation and raises the observed mean, but
   213	does not establish an effect on the score, and raising the cap also changes how long a
   214	summary may be, not only whether the same summary is cut. Uncut, Memory still stays well
   215	below ReAct (0.978). Haiku's Memory column is therefore read as *our summariser with a cap one

